{title: Safar}
{artist: Kabir Sehgal}

{start_of_chorus: Mukhda}
[D]Chal pade hain [A]hum kahan
[Bm]Na koi manzil [G]na nishaan
[D]Yeh safar hai [A]bas tera mera
[G]Baaki saara [A]jahaan dhuaan
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Antara 1}
[Bm]Pehli baar jo [G]dekha tujhe
[D]Station ki us [A]bheed mein
[Bm]Lagta tha jaise [G]jaanta hoon
[D]Pichhle kisi [A]janam se main
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Mukhda}
[D]Chal pade hain [A]hum kahan
[Bm]Na koi manzil [G]na nishaan
[D]Yeh safar hai [A]bas tera mera
[G]Baaki saara [A]jahaan dhuaan
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Antara 2}
[Bm]Patri pe dhoop [G]bichhi hui
[D]Pedon ki lambi [A]qatar
[Bm]Tu so gayi [G]kandhe pe mere
[D]Thehra raha [A]yeh pal magar
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Mukhda}
[D]Chal pade hain [A]hum kahan
[Bm]Na koi manzil [G]na nishaan
[D]Yeh safar hai [A]bas tera mera
[G]Baaki saara [A]jahaan dhuaan
{end_of_chorus}
